+# TLS Certificate Verification (Development Builds)
+
+This project has no current recorded decision governing TLS certificate verification in development builds. A workaround disabling certificate verification for dev builds was raised and then explicitly retired, but no replacement policy was subsequently recorded, so there is nothing on record to state as the project's current position on this topic.
